{
  "format": "pinmame-harness-scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "game": "harl_a13",
  "notes": "Boot harl_a13 with four balls on trough switches 11-14, the stacking opto 15 at 0 and the motorcycle down on 36, with PinMAME's built-in motorcycle mechanism off (--handle-mechanics 0) so the scenario alone writes 35 and 36. Walk the Portals service menu with the Black ENTER button (public 0): Portals, MAIN MENU (DIAG), DIAGNOSTICS MENU (SW), SWITCH TEST MENU (TEST), and enter the Switch Test, which prints for about a second after each closure the name, the drive and return wire colours and the number the ROM holds for that switch. Close every matrix address 1-64 once, reading the display 0.7 s after the closure; an address closed at boot is first opened and is left closed again afterwards.",
